<main>
  <p class="eyebrow">SEC EDGAR · XBRL Company Facts · Q2 2026 Earnings Season</p>
  <h1>How the seven money-center banks are trending</h1>
  <p class="byline"><a href="https://www.otnnamadim.com">Aperture Insights</a> · Generated on July 18, 2026</p>
  <p class="intro">
    Every series below is pulled programmatically from each bank's SEC filings via the
    EDGAR Company Facts API — the same numbers management signed, not headline
    summaries. Where this quarter's 10-Q is still outstanding, preliminary figures from
    the earnings-release 8-K are shown as ★ and clearly separated from filed data.
  </p>
  

  <div class="controls" role="group" aria-label="View filters">
    <span class="label">Frequency</span>
